  "scene_module": "scenes_musa",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "title": null,
      "scene": "hook",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "26:61",
          "w": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, we are to be overtaken"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "26:62",
          "w": [
            1,
            6
          ],
          "en": "No! Indeed, with me is my Lord; He will guide me"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "title": "From the River to the Sea",
          "sub": "The Story of Prophet Musa (AS)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Tyrant of Egypt",
      "scene": "palace",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "28:4",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, Pharaoh exalted himself in the land"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "28:5",
          "w": [
            1,
            12
          ],
          "en": "And We wanted to confer favor upon those who were oppressed in the land and make them leaders and make them inheritors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Basket on the River",
      "scene": "river",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "28:7",
          "w": [
            7,
            22
          ],
          "en": "when you fear for him, cast him into the river and do not fear and do not grieve. Indeed, We will return him to you and will make him [one] of the messengers"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "28:9",
          "w": [
            4,
            9
          ],
          "en": "a comfort of the eye for me and for you. Do not kill him"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "q": "28:13",
          "w": [
            9,
            13
          ],
          "en": "and that she would know that the promise of Allah is true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "One Blow in the City",
      "scene": "city",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 0,
          "q": "28:14",
          "w": [
            5,
            7
          ],
          "en": "We bestowed upon him judgement and knowledge"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "28:16",
          "w": [
            2,
            8
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, indeed I have wronged myself, so forgive me,\" and He forgave him"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "28:20",
          "w": [
            8,
            14
          ],
          "en": "O Moses, indeed the eminent ones are conferring over you [intending] to kill you, so leave [the city]"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "28:21",
          "w": [
            6,
            10
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Well of Madyan",
      "scene": "madyan",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "28:24",
          "w": [
            8,
            15
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, indeed I am, for whatever good You would send down to me, in need"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "28:25",
          "w": [
            21,
            26
          ],
          "en": "Fear not. You have escaped from the wrongdoing people"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Fire on the Mountain",
      "scene": "tur",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "28:29",
          "w": [
            7,
            11
          ],
          "en": "he perceived from the direction of the mount a fire"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "20:12",
          "w": [
            1,
            9
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, I am your Lord, so remove your sandals. Indeed, you are in the sacred valley of Tuwa"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "20:14",
          "w": [
            1,
            11
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, I am Allah. There is no deity except Me, so worship Me and establish prayer for My remembrance"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "20:20",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "So he threw it down, and thereupon it was a snake, moving swiftly"
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "q": "20:24",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Expand My Chest",
      "scene": "tur2",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "20:25",
          "w": [
            2,
            5
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, expand for me my breast"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "20:30",
          "w": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "en": "Aaron, my brother"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "20:44",
          "w": [
            1,
            8
          ],
          "en": "And speak to him with gentle speech that perhaps he may be reminded or fear [Allah]"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "q": "20:46",
          "w": [
            2,
            7
          ],
          "en": "Fear not. Indeed, I am with you both; I hear and I see"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Before Pharaoh",
      "scene": "throne",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "20:47",
          "w": [
            3,
            11
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, we are messengers of your Lord, so send with us the Children of Israel and do not torment them"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "79:24",
          "w": [
            2,
            4
          ],
          "en": "I am your most exalted lord"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Magicians",
      "scene": "arena",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "20:66",
          "w": [
            4,
            12
          ],
          "en": "And suddenly their ropes and staffs seemed to him from their magic that they were moving"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "20:68",
          "w": [
            2,
            6
          ],
          "en": "Fear not. Indeed, it is you who are superior"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "7:117",
          "w": [
            7,
            11
          ],
          "en": "and at once it devoured what they were falsifying"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "20:70",
          "w": [
            1,
            8
          ],
          "en": "So the magicians fell down in prostration. They said, \"We have believed in the Lord of Aaron and Moses"
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "q": "20:72",
          "w": [
            2,
            10
          ],
          "en": "Never will we prefer you over what has come to us of clear proofs and [over] He who created us"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Signs",
      "scene": "plagues",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "7:133",
          "w": [
            1,
            9
          ],
          "en": "So We sent upon them the flood and locusts and lice and frogs and blood as distinct signs"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "26:52",
          "w": [
            5,
            8
          ],
          "en": "Travel by night with My servants; indeed, you will be pursued"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Sea",
      "scene": "parting",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "26:63",
          "w": [
            4,
            13
          ],
          "en": "Strike with your staff the sea,\" and it parted, and each portion was like a great towering mountain"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "20:77",
          "w": [
            8,
            13
          ],
          "en": "strike for them a dry path through the sea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Now?",
      "scene": "drown",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "26:65",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "And We saved Moses and those with him, all together"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "10:90",
          "w": [
            15,
            27
          ],
          "en": "I believe that there is no deity except that in whom the Children of Israel believe, and I am of the Muslims"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "10:91",
          "w": [
            1,
            7
          ],
          "en": "Now? And you had disobeyed [Him] before and were of the corrupters"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "10:92",
          "w": [
            1,
            7
          ],
          "en": "So today We will save you in body that you may be to those who succeed you a sign"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Lesson",
      "scene": "lesson2",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "26:62",
          "w": [
            1,
            6
          ],
          "en": "No! Indeed, with me is my Lord; He will guide me"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
